OL,3,GNEWSAPiano society holds last recital
OL,4,Aat closed museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FA piano society founded during World
OL,7,FWar Two has held its last recital at
OL,8,Fthe museum it called home.
OL,10,FSunderland Pianoforte Society has for
OL,11,Fdecades hosted performances at the
OL,12,Fcity's Museum and Winter Gardens, which
OL,13,Fshut in August ahead of a two-year
OL,14,Frefurbishment.
OL,16,FDespite the closure, on Tuesday the
OL,17,Fsociety was given the chance to hold
OL,18,Fone last performance on its Model D
OL,19,FSteinway, which it has kept at the
OL,20,Fmuseum since the 1960s.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
