OL,3,GNEWSAPiano society holds last recital
OL,4,Aat closed museum
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the society moving to Hope Street
OL,7,FXchange in the city centre, Chair
OL,8,FEileen Bown thanked the museum for a
OL,9,F"long and really happy relationship"
OL,10,Fbut said it was unclear whether the
OL,11,Fgroup and piano would be able to return
OL,12,Fafter the revamped facility reopened.
